\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Maintains "Taste" and Intent:
\f2\b0  Pure JSON design tokens only give the AI a variable (e.g., 
\f3\fs26 \cb3 --color-primary: #11171B
\f2\fs24 \cb1 ). A 
\f3\fs26 \cb3 DESIGN.md
\f2\fs24 \cb1  file goes a step further by explaining that the primary color should evoke structural authority and should only be applied to headings. [3, 5, 8, 9]\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Context Preservation:
\f2\b0  LLMs process Markdown effortlessly. Because both values and contextual rationale sit in the same document, the AI references it natively without costly API lookups to design tools. [2, 7]\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
